id: FEND6-1
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: host_contract
target: crates/web/src/host.rs
find:         root_attrs.extend(ESC_KEYDOWN_ATTRS);
replace:         let _ = ESC_KEYDOWN_ATTRS;
expect-fail: workshop_root_は_esc_の_keydown_属性を持つ
note: workshop-root に Esc の属性が無く、main の外の部品（workshop-parts）の Esc が 0 回になる
